 "description": "\n <ul>\n  <li>REFLECTIVE STITCHING FOR NIGHTTIME SAFETY – The harness features bright reflective strips and fluorescent trim that make your dog highly visible in low-light conditions. Whether you're walking early morning or late evening, this harness helps keep you and your pet safe and secure.</li>\n  <li>BREATHABLE &amp; COMFORTABLE DESIGN – Made with breathable air mesh fabric that provides a super soothing experience for your dog. The material is well-padded at every pressure load point to protect your dog's skin, ensuring comfort during long walks or outdoor adventures.</li>\n  <li>NO-PULL DESIGN WITH ADJUSTABLE FIT – The harness helps prevent pulling, tugging, and choking, making walks more enjoyable for both you and your dog. The adjustable chest strap ensures a customized fit for dogs of various sizes, from small to large breeds.</li>\n  <li>STURDY CONSTRUCTION WITH STAINLESS STEEL D-RING – Built with durable polyester and a stainless steel D-ring for secure leash attachment. The removable hook-and-loop strips and load-bearing buckles ensure no deformation or breakage during movement, providing long-lasting reliability.</li>\n  <li>CONVENIENT HANDLE &amp; FLASHLIGHT POSITION – The harness includes a sturdy carry handle for easy control and assistance. A dedicated flashlight position adds extra visibility and convenience for nighttime walks, making it a versatile choice for outdoor activities.<br><p><b>Chest circumference<br>XS: 38~50 cm<br>S: 45~55 cm<br>M: 55~65 cm<br>L: 68~80 cm<br>XL: 80~95 cm</b></p><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/18c91801-beff-4028-a66d-abbf7a3581b0.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/a623c5ae-cc4f-4f22-92a7-fbc5ae660f3c.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/abd7708e-6bb2-45aa-aa9d-eeb3a092826b.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" contenteditable=\"false\"></li>\n </ul>\n",
